window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When your soul is torn apart, and your heart feels empty, how do you breathe?</b></p> <p>When the flames of hell burn bright, and all hope seems lost, how do you survive?</p> <p>When war is coming for those you love, and darkness prepares to strike, how do you face the wrath?</p> <p>When truths are awoken, and the supernatural world is brought to its knees, how do you rise back up?</p> <p>The time for questions has passed. It is time to act. Time to fight. Time to conquer evil once and for all.</p> <p>May courage drive you. May you know no fear. May we all rest in peace wherever our pieces may fall.</p>"; 
